        <mxCell id="40" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="SwapTx Alice" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="105" width="320" x="860" y="480" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="41" parent="40" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b&gt;Output 0:&lt;/b&gt; seller payout - mining fee, to a new address of Alice's wallet&lt;br&gt;Only Alice knows this transaction. Bob signs its signature hash when he starts the payment." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="75" width="320" y="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="42" edge="1" parent="1" source="40" style="rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;exitX=0;exitY=0.25;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;labelBackgroundColor=none;fontColor=default;" target="14">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="53" connectable="0" parent="42" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];" value="MuSig2 adaptor signature&lt;br&gt;reveals p&lt;sub&gt;a&lt;/sub&gt; only to Bob" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="-35" y="46" as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="43" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Diagram synced with code 2026-11-19&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 24px;&quot;&gt;Alice: Seller&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Bob: Buyer&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 11px;&quot;&gt;P' = MuSig2 aggregate of the key shares P&lt;sub&gt;a&lt;/sub&gt; and P&lt;sub&gt;b&lt;/sub&gt; (key of the buyer payout), Q' = aggregate of Q&lt;sub&gt;a&lt;/sub&gt; and Q&lt;sub&gt;b&lt;/sub&gt; (key of the seller payout)&lt;br&gt;an output with key spend P' or Q' is locked by that key, tweaked with its script spend 0 (if any)&lt;br&gt;Q&lt;sub&gt;a&lt;/sub&gt; and P&lt;sub&gt;b&lt;/sub&gt; are the claim keys of Alice and Bob; their private keys are never given away&lt;br&gt;U and V are script keys from the wallets of Alice and Bob&lt;br&gt;payout address: one wallet address per trader, used by the ClaimTx, PenaltyTx, CustomPayoutTx and DepositAbortTx&lt;br&gt;change outputs, funding from multiple inputs, the trade fee output (at most one, paid by Alice) and the child transactions that raise a fee are not shown&lt;br&gt;specification: docs/specifications/trade/transactions.md&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="240" width="560" x="10" y="-140" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="44" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;" value="Redirect Tx&lt;br&gt;Bob / Alice" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="135" width="260" x="1380" y="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="45" parent="44" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Outputs 0 ... n-1:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; outputs to the n redirection receivers (burning men of the Bisq DAO)." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="55" width="260" y="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="62" parent="44" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Output n:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; anchor output 330 sats, to the wallet of Bob / Alice." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="50" width="260" y="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="60" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1&gt;Transactions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 230, 204);&quot;&gt;Funding transactions. Keys / signatures for spending come from the wallet crate. The wallet also signs the CustomPayoutTx (script keys U and V) and the DepositAbortTx. The signatures for all other transactions are made by the protocol crate.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(213, 232, 212);&quot;&gt;Only the DepositTx is broadcast at the time of creation. The transactions right of it are broadcast later, when the necessary fee rate can be higher than the fee rate that was fixed at the start of the trade. If a transaction stays unconfirmed, the engine raises its fee: with a child transaction that spends the anchor output (WarningTx, RedirectTx) or the trader's own output (SwapTx, PenaltyTx, CustomPayoutTx, change of the DepositTx), or with a replacement (ClaimTx, DepositAbortTx).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(225, 213, 231);&quot;&gt;These transactions are presigned with MuSig2, at the prepared fee rate of the trade. The WarningTx and the RedirectTx are created and signed when the trade starts (before the DepositTx is signed and broadcast), when both traders are online. Each trader holds the full signatures only for the own WarningTx and RedirectTx. Bob gives his partial signature for the SwapTx when he starts the payment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(176, 227, 230);&quot;&gt;CustomPayoutTx, PenaltyTx, ClaimTx and DepositAbortTx are transactions signed on demand. The CustomPayoutTx is created when the traders agree on a payout, both wallets sign it with the script keys U and V. The PenaltyTx is signed by one trader alone, after the key exchange. The ClaimTx is signed by one trader alone with the claim key, after the claim lock time. The DepositAbortTx is signed by the wallet of one trader, when the DepositTx is not confirmed after the deposit timeout (default 144 blocks). Only one of DepositTx and DepositAbortTx can confirm.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="385" width="560" x="30" y="540" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="64" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#b0e3e6;strokeColor=#0e8088;" value="PenaltyTx&lt;br&gt;Bob / Alice" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="230" width="260" x="1380" y="-185" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="65" parent="64" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="signed by Bob / Alice alone with the private key p' / q', as soon as the peer's key share is known (key exchange of a cooperative close; for Bob also from the published SwapTx). Published when the WarningTx of Alice / Bob confirms. It discourages the use of the WarningTx when the peer has the key already." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="130" width="260" y="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="66" parent="64" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Output 0:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; escrow - mining fee&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;to:&lt;/b&gt; payout address of Bob / Alice (same address as in the ClaimTx Bob / Alice)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="260" y="160" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="67" edge="1" parent="1" source="64" style="rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="17">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="84" connectable="0" parent="67" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];" value="key spend with&lt;br&gt;private key p' / q'&lt;br&gt;no relative lock time" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="-10" y="-35" as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="69" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#b0e3e6;strokeColor=#0e8088;" value="ClaimTx Alice / Bob" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="185" width="260" x="1380" y="255" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="88" parent="69" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="not presigned. Built and signed by Alice / Bob alone with the claim key, when the claim lock time has passed, at the fee rate of that moment. It can be replaced with a higher fee." vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="30" width="260" height="85" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="70" parent="69" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Output 0:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; escrow - mining fee&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;to:&lt;/b&gt; payout address of Alice / Bob (same address as in the PenaltyTx Alice / Bob)" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="70" width="260" y="115" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="72" edge="1" parent="1" source="69" style="rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;" target="17">
