        <mxCell id="79" edge="1" parent="1" source="75" style="rounded=0;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;html=1;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;" target="14">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="86" connectable="0" parent="79" style="edgeLabel;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];" value="both inputs: script spend 0&lt;br&gt;signatures of U and V" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry">
            <mxPoint x="35" y="24" as="offset" />
          </mxGeometry>
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="87" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;spacing=5;spacingTop=-20;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1&gt;Relative lock times&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;nSequence of the inputs, see EngineConfig and REDIRECT_LOCK_TIME in params.rs:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;warning lock time (WarningTx): default 1440 blocks (10 days)&lt;br&gt;claim lock time (ClaimTx): default 720 blocks (5 days)&lt;br&gt;redirect lock time (RedirectTx): 1 block, a constant of the protocol&lt;br&gt;SwapTx, PenaltyTx, CustomPayoutTx and DepositAbortTx: none (nSequence 0xFFFFFFFD)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The warning lock time and the claim lock time are configuration values of musigd (BISQ_MUSIG_WARNING_LOCK_TIME, BISQ_MUSIG_CLAIM_LOCK_TIME). Both traders must use the same values.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Mining fees&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;fee rate x fixed weight of the signed transaction: WarningTx 846 wu and SwapTx 444 wu at the prepared fee rate; PenaltyTx 444 wu at the prepared fee rate, unless another one is set at the close; CustomPayoutTx 1182 wu at the fee rate of the request. The RedirectTx pays what the receivers and the anchor leave over.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;ClaimTx and DepositAbortTx: fee rate of the engine (10 sat/vB for now) x their own weight. They are replaced with a higher fee while they stay unconfirmed. The DepositAbortTx pays more than the whole fee of the DepositTx, so that it can replace it.&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="400" width="540" x="640" y="620" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="90" parent="1" style="swimlane;fontStyle=0;childLayout=stackLayout;horizontal=1;startSize=30;horizontalStack=0;resizeParent=1;resizeParentMax=0;resizeLast=0;collapsible=1;marginBottom=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;fillColor=#b0e3e6;strokeColor=#0e8088;" value="DepositAbortTx Alice / Bob" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry x="30" y="295" width="220" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="91" parent="90" style="text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;labelBackgroundColor=none;" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;Output 0:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt; own inputs of the DepositTx - mining fee, to the payout address of Alice / Bob" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry y="30" width="220" height="60" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
